          "explanation": "The Classic Maya collapse (800-925 CE) is now understood as a **multi-causal cascade**. **Lake sediment cores** (Hodell, Curtis) and **stalagmite analysis** (Kennett 2012) confirm a multi-decade drought worst in 7,000 years. **LiDAR** has revealed extensive defensive walls and political fragmentation. **Pollen analysis** documents deforestation and soil exhaustion. **Bioarchaeology** shows declining late-Classic health. The Spanish arrived ~600 years AFTER the collapse — they conquered the postclassic Maya, not the Classic. Single-cause explanations have all failed; the consensus is that **compounding stressors broke the system**.",
          "visual": {
            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The compound failure</text>\n                    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"220\" width=\"800\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">MULTIPLE CAUSES</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Drought + soil exhaustion</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">+ warfare + fragmentation</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"435\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">+ disease</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Lake + stalagmite + LiDAR + bone</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">All converge on the same story</text>\n                    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"640\" width=\"800\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Civilizations don't fall to bullets</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"750\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">They fall to cascading failures</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">When elites deny the data</text>\n                </svg>",
            "caption": "Compound collapse"
          }
