            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">ANCIENT DNA</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Reich + Paabo revolution</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"200\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">2010 - NEANDERTHAL GENOME</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Paabo: non-Africans ~2% Neanderthal</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"340\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">2010 - DENISOVANS</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">New lineage from a single finger bone</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"480\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"530\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">2022 - PAABO NOBEL PRIZE</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Physiology or Medicine</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"620\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"670\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">REICH LAB: 10,000+ GENOMES</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"710\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Population-scale aDNA</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"760\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"810\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">YAMNAYA + BELL BEAKER</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Massive prehistoric migrations</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"900\" width=\"900\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"950\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Petrous bone = the new gold mine</text>\n                </svg>",
            "caption": "aDNA timeline"
